<H2>
<BR>
Hayama Symposium on Several Complex Variables was first held <BR>
in March 20 - 29, 1995, it was the third in the series of the<BR>    
International Research Institute of the Mathematical Society of <BR> 
Japan.   Since then, Hayama Symposium on Several Complex  Variables  <BR>
  have been held in the second half of every December, and because of  <BR>
 this reason  it is called "X'mas Symposium in Hayama" by some  <BR>
mathematicians.
<BR>
</H2>
